  "adaptations": [
    "Pure v1 host-confirmed movement, hearing and exposure boundaries; raw/effective Sneak remain distinct.",
    "Original foliage geometry plus ordered smaller buckets/boolean early-out, cached only within immutable map revisions.",
    "Native goat/hands/rifle only, selected original shirt/limb/carry math, mutually exclusive gait/crawl/action owner.",
    "Study root compensated once; a strict durable signed-travel cursor replaces Fighters temporary samples.",
    "Body uses original normal paint at native resolution; rifle retains its native geometry/default materials."
  ],
  "scope": "Original files are reference-only slices, not executable module closures. Runtime adapters reuse the existing pinned goat, native rifle, geometry and single Three closure. Original imports remain byte-preserved. No donor game runtime is imported.",
  "rights": "Source provenance grants no additional rights. No blanket license was found in the reviewed donor roots. Retain existing artwork and Three notices; no new art or Three copy is adopted."
